    "detailed_description": "Returning to his native land, the main character did not recognize what his beloved Voronezh had become. There are only bandits and drug addicts around, who have filled the entire area and are preventing normal people from living, which is why the main character decided to clear out the main lair of all the bandits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRestless Voronezh - A game in the Top Down Shooter genre, where the player controls a hero and, using various available means, deals with his enemies in cramped rooms of a huge building, clearing floor after floor. One blow or bullet will become a deadly lesson for the player, be vigilant and careful.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl:<br />\r\nWASD - walking<br />\r\nLeft Mouse Button - shoot/punch<br />\r\nRight Mouse Button - pick up/throw away weapons<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- Visual style<br />\r\n- Top Down Shooter<br />\r\n- Difficulty",
